# Frame captures while the tank turns on the spot, for checking that it
# doesn't flash (tools/flicker.py counts frames with the tank missing).
# Debug build made with EXTRA="-DDEMO_START -DAUTOQUIT_SECONDS=30". The
# left arrow on the TG50 keyboard is held for 6 s from 8 s.
2000 pen-down 80 240
2100 pen-up
3500 pen-down 66 300
3600 pen-up
5000 pen-down 66 300
5100 pen-up
